1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,220
What if ChatGPT was installed in your brain?

2
00:00:03,390 --> 00:00:04,780
This isn't pure sci-fi.

3
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:08,760
Dozens of people already have chips in their brains, controlling computers just by thinking.

4
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:09,570
So imagine it.

5
00:00:09,590 --> 00:00:11,170
Every language? You speak it.

6
00:00:11,190 --> 00:00:12,930
Every exam? Every fact?

7
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:13,460
Instantly.

8
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:15,560
You'd be the smartest person in history.

9
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,520
Until the twist.

10
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:21,380
Scientists measured the speed of human thought: about ten bits per second.

11
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:23,580
Slower than an old dial-up modem.

12
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,320
So the AI could know everything, but you'd still think it one thought at a time.

13
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:28,620
Now give it to everyone.

14
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:30,960
Every test? Everyone scores a hundred.

15
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:33,360
Knowing things stops being special.

16
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:37,220
And if everyone asks the same AI, we might all start thinking the same thoughts.

17
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,280
So what would still make you special?

18
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:40,730
Not the answers.

19
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:42,060
The questions you ask.

20
00:00:42,370 --> 00:00:44,180
So, would you install it?

21
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:45,090
Yes or no?

22
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:46,140
Tell me in the comments.
